        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Global TH1100-FBWUL-US26D, Brushed Chrome UL Listed  Flush Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe UL Listed Flush Bolt for Wood Doors is used to secure the inactive door on a set of double doors no matter if the active door is open or closed. When the inactive door is closed, moving the lock lever up locks it and moving the lever down unlocks it. This flush bolt has a 24 inch extension with a 1-1/2 inch adjustable bolt head. UL Listed, this Brushed Chrome finished flush bolt is for use on wood doors up to 4 feet x 8 feet for up to 3 hour fire rating. It comes packaged with installation hardware, guide plate, and strike plate.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nCross Reference--The Global TH1100-FBUL Flush Bolt can be used in place of the following: Ives FB458, ABH 1855S, Hager 282D, Trimco 3917, Rockwood 555, and Don-Jo 1555.\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Wood Door Flush Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI 156.16. UL Listed for up to 3 hours.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with strike and guide plates</li>\r\n<li>1-1/2\" adjustable bolt head.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the UL Listed Flush Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: Brushed Chrome</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Plate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Holes: 5-7/32\" Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Extension Rod: 2' Length, 1/4-20 Thread</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Adjustment: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>5/8\" adjustment on rod length</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate: 2-1/4\"  x 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Guide Plate: 2\"  x 15/16\"</li>\r\n<!-- <li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GLO-TH1100FBUL-specification.pdf?v=1704262318\" target=\"new\"><b>Global TH1100-FBUL Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li> -->\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
